Unitree G1 29-DoF robot description used by g1_backflip_mujoco
================================================================

Origin: wb_humanoid_mpc (https://github.com/manumerous/wb_humanoid_mpc, git submodule src/wb_humanoid_mpc),
robot_models/unitree_g1/g1_description: urdf/g1_29dof.urdf, urdf/g1_29dof.xml and meshes/, which derive from
Unitree Robotics' unitree_ros g1_description (BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2016-2024 HangZhou YuShu
TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD. ("Unitree Robotics")). wb_humanoid_mpc: BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2025 Manuel Yves
Galliker, Copyright (c) 2024 1X Technologies.

Generated with scripts/generate_model.py (meshes are referenced in the submodule, not copied):
  * urdf/g1_29dof_flip.urdf: visual / collision elements removed, massless root link flip_base added
  * g1_29dof.xml: scene removed, 1 kHz RK4, torque limits as ctrlrange, no self-collision, stiff foot contacts,
    joint armature / damping / friction, sites at the foot contact frames

